# A delayed triggered ability is controlled by the player who controlled the ability that created it (CR 603.7d-e), whoever
# controls its source afterwards. Bot1's Showdown of the Skalds reaches chapter II on turn 13: "whenever you cast a spell this
# turn, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control" is Bot1's. Bot2, who took Dack Fayden to 6 loyalty and used his
# -6 on turn 12, then casts Restoration Magic's Cure on the Saga, and Dack's emblem gives Bot2 the Saga (checked). Bot1's
# Mox Jet still triggers the chapter's ability, which puts the counter on Bot1's Llanowar Elves.

